{'symbol': 'CZR', 'date': '2021-04-22 08:30:00', 'title': 'CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT ANNOUNCES COMPLETION OF WILLIAM HILL PLC ACQUISITION', 'text': 'LAS VEGAS AND RENO, NEV., APRIL 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT, INC. (NASDAQ: CZR) ("CAESARS" OR "THE COMPANY") TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMPLETED ITS ACQUISITION OF WILLIAM HILL PLC (LSE: WMH) ("WILLIAM HILL") FOR APPROXIMATELY $4.0 BILLION.'}